# explainer-short (M11): in a short window (1100 x 720) the card keeps 16 px inside it: a's explainer
# rises to y 315 (720 - 16 - 389) and its caret follows the chip, 109.5 px down the card.
size 1100 720
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 70 424
wait 1100
shot explainer-short
